OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1789392353
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGran 'shell shocked' at Black
OL,4,APudding Throwing world title
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeir, who was one of four competitors
OL,7,Fwho toppled six Yorkshire puddings from
OL,8,Fa ledge, said: "This was my third time,
OL,9,Fno training whatsoever... and I
OL,10,Factually won it. I can't believe it."
